<div style="background-color: #a6e3e8; border-radius: 40px; color: #000000; width: 95%; padding: 1px 20px 1px 20px;">

<p style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 10px; margin-right: 10px; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px; "> <b>💡Teacher Tip:</b> Take time to explore the lesson and lesson resources before you teach. Practice in Web Lab and anticipate student challenges. Use the <b>AI Teaching Assistant</b> to help you with just-in-time professional learning.
</p>
</div>

